# Requests for every endpoint. Open in Visual Studio / VS Code (REST Client) / Rider and click "Send".
@api = http://localhost:5000

### Health (ai = true when a Claude key is set)
GET {{api}}/api/health

### Today's panchang for New Delhi
GET {{api}}/api/panchang?date=2026-10-26&lat=28.6139&lng=77.209&tz=Asia/Kolkata&system=Purnimanta

### Month calendar
GET {{api}}/api/panchang/month?year=2026&month=11&lat=28.6139&lng=77.209&tz=Asia/Kolkata

### Muhurat occasions
GET {{api}}/api/muhurat/events

### Vivah muhurat, Nov 2026 – Jan 2027
GET {{api}}/api/muhurat?event=Vivah&from=2026-11-01&to=2027-01-31&lat=28.6139&lng=77.209&tz=Asia/Kolkata

### Mantras
GET {{api}}/api/mantras

### One mantra (with karaoke timings)
GET {{api}}/api/mantras/gayatri

### Scriptures
GET {{api}}/api/scriptures

### Gita chapter 2
GET {{api}}/api/scriptures/gita/verses?chapter=2

### Search verses
GET {{api}}/api/scriptures/search?q=anger

### Ask PanditJi (non-streaming)
POST {{api}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "What does the Gita say about anger?", "language": "hi", "latitude": 28.6139, "longitude": 77.209, "timeZone": "Asia/Kolkata" }

### Import a text (needs Admin:ApiKey)
POST {{api}}/api/scriptures/import
X-Admin-Key: change-me
Content-Type: application/json

[{ "code": "yoga-sutra", "name": "Yoga Sutras", "nameDevanagari": "योगसूत्र",
   "verses": [{ "chapter": 1, "verse": "2", "sanskrit": "योगश्चित्तवृत्तिनिरोधः", "translationEn": "Yoga is the stilling of the fluctuations of the mind." }] }]
